DisplayMOD for the M5Stack CardputerZero
=========================================

Adds a 2.8" ILI9341 SPI display (the EXT display) to the EXT header.

Wiring (power off first)
  VCC  -> pin 6  (5V out)       GND  -> pin 4
  CS   -> pin 13 (G7)           RESET-> pin 5  (G22)
  DC   -> pin 3  (G23)          SDI  -> pin 9  (G10)
  SCK  -> pin 7  (G11)          LED  -> pin 1  (G26)
  SDO  -> pin 11 (G9), used to detect the display at boot
  Leave the touch and SD pins unconnected. Never use pin 2 (5V in).

Apps
  DisplayMOD   settings: mirroring, layout, brightness, built-in screen,
               BigTermCLI history, EXT display setup, status, wiring
  BigTermCLI   terminal on the EXT display (when enabled). Same keys as
               the CLI app; fn+H help, hold Esc to quit. History is saved
               after every command and kept across reboots.

Settings
  Quick settings (brightness, border color, sleep, built-in screen, history)
  apply at once. Settings that restart the EXT display are queued and shown
  in amber; press A in the app (p in the displaymod command) to apply them
  together.

Terminal
  displaymod                 same settings as the app (e.g. over SSH)
  sudo apt remove displaymod remove it

